      <h1 id="preparing-to-install-on-gcp" class="group scroll-mt-20">Preparing to install on {"{"}{"{"} gcp_short {"}"}{"}"}<a href="#preparing-to-install-on-gcp" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <h2 id="preparing-to-install-on-gcp-prerequisites" class="group scroll-mt-20">Prerequisites<a href="#preparing-to-install-on-gcp-prerequisites" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <ul>
      <li>You reviewed details about the <a href="/architecture/architecture-installation#architecture-installation">OpenShift Container Platform installation and update</a> processes.</li>
